<section v-show="selected==='coverage'"><div class="section-heading"><p class="muted">查看自动映射、下载命中和本地副本。</p><a href="/admin/mirror/settings/sources">管理来源 →</a></div><div class="mirror-admin-actions"><button id="mirror-source-scan" type="button" class="secondary">立即增量扫描</button><a href="/admin/mirror/tasks">查看后台活动 →</a></div><p id="mirror-source-notice" role="status" class="muted small"></p><div class="admin-card"><h3>覆盖与命中统计</h3><p class="muted small">核验文件数表示覆盖范围，可在多个源重复计数；下载命中表示本服务实际发出的下载重定向次数，不等于远端已完成下载。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>来源</th><th>已核验文件</th><th>本地副本</th><th>下载命中</th><th>文件明细</th></tr></thead><tbody id="mirror-source-statistics"></tbody></table></div></div><div class="admin-card"><div class="section-heading"><h3>文件明细</h3><label>查看来源<select id="mirror-source-filter"><option value="">全部来源</option></select></label></div><p id="mirror-source-file-count" class="muted small">选择来源查看已核验文件。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>文件 / SHA-1</th><th>来源</th><th>本地副本</th><th>下载命中</th></tr></thead><tbody id="mirror-source-files"></tbody></table></div><div class="action-row"><button id="mirror-source-prev" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>上一页</button><button id="mirror-source-next" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>下一页</button></div></div><div class="admin-card"><h3>匹配后清理本地副本</h3><p class="muted small">默认关闭。仅处理校验值一致且已有直接映射的文件；清理前重新检查目标文件与大小。正在下载、发送或备份的文件跳过；共享对象保留到所有本地引用均可移除。清理后该文件按映射直接从外部来源下载。</p><div class="mirror-admin-actions"><button id="mirror-source-preview" type="button" class="secondary">计算可释放空间</button><button id="mirror-source-clean" type="button" disabled>移除已匹配的本地副本</button></div><p id="mirror-source-cleanup-preview" role="status" class="muted small">先预览匹配数量与预计可释放空间。</p><ul id="mirror-source-cleanup-files" class="muted small source-file-path"></ul></div></section>
